  <div class="curator-msg float-right">
    <p>While migration accelerated in the wake of the 2017 hurricane season, many islanders have chosen to remain in the Caribbean. The St. Croix-based photographer David Berg distills the experience of those who remain in the Caribbean in his eerie photograph &ldquo;Still Here.&rdquo;</p>

    <p>Learn more about <a class="link" href="{{ '/people/#dberg' | url }}">David Berg</a> and Blackwood Imaging.</p>
